<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 467 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 467 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banks bid for 81 million zlotys of 91-day National Bank of Poland's bills and for 386 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
